IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-KANGAROO-EXIT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CURRENT-LAYER       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TOTAL-LAYERS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CONFIDENCE-INT      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SHALLOW-EXIT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 DRAFT-ACCEPTED      PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-KANGAROO.
    IF TOTAL-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE SHALLOW-EXIT = TOTAL-LAYERS / 3.
    MOVE 0 TO DRAFT-ACCEPTED.

    IF CONFIDENCE-INT >= 80
        IF CURRENT-LAYER >= SHALLOW-EXIT
            MOVE 1 TO DRAFT-ACCEPTED.
        END-IF.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 DRAFT-ACCEPTED.
    WEIGHT 30 CURRENT-LAYER.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
